<title>PERU: LIMA BOLSA LISTS GRANA Y MONTERO CONSTRUCTION FIRM.</title>
<headline>LIMA BOLSA LISTS GRANA Y MONTERO CONSTRUCTION FIRM.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peruvian construction firm Grana y Montero has formally registered on the Lima Stock Exchange, and brokers will be able to trade its shares next week, the bolsa said Thursday.</p>
<p>It will be Grana y Montero's second public issue after last September's $15 million corporate bond placement through a subsidiary.</p>
<p>Grana y Montero is one of the biggest construction firms in Peru.  In the past year it has benefited from a series of contracts for hotels, shopping centers and other buildings.</p>
<p>((-- Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134))</p>
